# app: whatsapp
# The first request on a link that just came up fails before it is sent (on the device: the name lookup or the connection): the net
# service waits a moment and sends it once more. The list is read, no toast. Twice in a row is a real failure: the saved list stays, with the toast.
wait 1500
wifi off
wifi on                 # the link is gone: the next request joins again
wifi hiccup 1
tap 504 92              # refresh
wait 3000
shot inbox-hiccup
expect-state Updated
wifi hiccup 2
tap 504 92              # refresh
wait 1200
shot inbox-hiccup-twice
expect-state Saved data
